&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:9pt;padding-right:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-9pt;line-height:12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:7.5pt;"&gt; ・サプライチェーンを含めた事業継続対策（BCP）の強化 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
